the RAID device locally and the Oracle database automatically 
starts on B, but the cluster alias CLUSTER does not properly
resolve.

We have a floating IP address for this cluster, it does 
correctly resolve to A and B. It's just that pesky UNC on
just one system. Does anyone have any suggestions for
fixing this strange problem?

