Mime-Version: 1.0
Newsgroups: comp.sys.dec

Hi

Just run into a small problem with XTerminals (actually PC's running
Exceed) connecting to an AS4000 running DU 4.0E with C2 turned on.
Whilst the Alpha starts to do things with the display, it fails with a
popup message saying 'Cannot obtain database information on this
terminal'.

Whilst I've been able to figure out that this is down to the C2 stuff
(the "terminal" isn't in the devices database), I haven't been able to
fix it. There doesn't seem to be an obvious mention of this problem in
the DU documentation.

Has anyone else encountered this, and more importantly has anyone
figured out a solution ?
