>
>
What did you upgrade from? Because when we went to 4.0d from 3.2G
we found that there was a cron job called defragcron that ran
each night at 1:00 and that if the powersave/spindown on the disk
happened before this process ran then the AdVFS crashed. The
solution was to disable powersave using dxpower and then stop the
defragcron job running each night, but instead having it run
under operator control on a regular basis.

Hope this helps, and if not then can you give more details of the
crash

Adam






