just what they achieve.  Theoretically they could have components
that break a lot less than those of competitors.  One particular
technique that does not involve hardware hotswap for maintaining
availability is clustering.  Downtime that is visible to the end
user is what counts, regardless of whether it is scheduled or
unanticipated.

