You can boot from MOPD on Linux, but in that case you cannot use
the remote swapfile feature of the Infoserver and are limited 
to the physical amount of memory in the VXT2000+

Maximum amount of memory for an VXT2000+ is 18MB, which is not
very much if you want to use it as a remote CDE login.

