             1/ o o o o o o o|o o o o o o \13   3 RD    Receive data
             '-/--|-|---|-|-|-\------------`    5 CTS   Clear to send
              /   | |   | | | |                 6 DSR   Data set ready
              |   |_|_  | | | |                 7       Signal ground
              |     | | | | | |                20 DTR   Data terminal
ready
              |     | |_|_|_/ |              |     |/| | |   |
              |     ||| | |   |              |   __|||_|_|   |
9-pin D-type  | 6/ o|o|o|o|\9 |female        | /1o|o o o o5\ |
              | `-||--------' |              `---'`----------'Notes:
     1.  Plugs viewed from outside.
     2.  The official DEC part number for this cable  is  BCC-08,
although
         BCC-05 is wired the same.
     3.  These connections are NOT the same as converters used on PCs.
     4.  Digital terminals only need pins 2, 3, and 7, as they use
XON/XOFF
