If its only a single shot, you CAN run Kermit some serial transfer protocol
on both the machines and transfer the data.    The speed is going to be
slow, so if it's a lot of data it'll take a while, but if you have the
time....

First, try to make a terminal emulator behave like a VT100 and log into the
VMS system, that way you are sure that the line is working before trying to
send the data

Then run Kermit as a server on VMS and use something on the PC end to
receive the files.


