  Is this Digital Unix or OSF/1 or whatever it's called this week?

  64MB is not a lot of memory for an Alpha - I have an AS2100 4/275 that
chews up 96MB just sitting at a DECwindows login prompt (under VMS).

  Does the hard disk activity light flash when the system stalls? That
